        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage FE285PLYxPLY, Plymouth Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Plymouth Handleset comes with the grip and interior trim. It is made out of sold brass. The Oval Plymouth Handleset will fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit 1-5/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch thick doors and comes packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2 inch door thicknesses.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Plymouth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Oval Plymouth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: Plymouth Knob</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Length: 12-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 2-9/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 1-4/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
